<title>USA: Encore Marketing to buyback shares.</title>
<headline>Encore Marketing to buyback shares.</headline>
<dateline>LANHAM, Md. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Encore Marketing International Inc said it intended to buy back up to 100,000 shares of its common stock in the open market, though the actual number of shares repurchased would depend on market conditions.</p>
<p>The time period for the repurchases had not been determined, the company said.</p>
<p>The company had about 3.23 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
